yuma123-netconfd-module-ietf-hardware-state-zigbee (1.0) bookworm; urgency=medium

  * Zigbee implementation for Aqara and IKEA sensors on a ZBT-2 dongle with its
    factory Zigbee/EZSP firmware
  * One long-running zigpy/bellows daemon (ietf-hardware-state-zigbeed) owns the
    radio and writes state.json; the stdlib-only helper ietf-hardware-state-zigbee
    turns it into ietf-hardware-state XML for netconfd (no MQTT, no containers)
  * permit-join through a command file, stale readings and a dead daemon are
    reported as oper-status unavailable
  * ZIGBEE_DEVICE selects one device for one netconfd instance per device
  * test/mock-zigbeed for testing without hardware, systemd unit in example/

 -- Joar Heimonen <spam@joar.me>  Thu, 21 Aug 2026 12:00:00 +0200

